["o", 0.2, "$ python demo.py\r\n"]
["o", 0.23500000000000001, "\r\n"]
["o", 0.27, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 0.30500000000000005, " 1. QUESTION - one sentence, metric named, cost estimated\r\n"]
["o", 0.3400000000000001, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 0.3750000000000001, "Does builtin sum() beat a manual for-loop on median full-pass time over\r\n"]
["o", 0.41000000000000014, "identical integer lists? Metric: median pass seconds. Cost: ~24 runs, seconds.\r\n"]
["o", 0.4450000000000002, "registry opened before the pilot:\r\n"]
["o", 0.4800000000000002, "appended: | D-001 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Pilot plan: 3 calibration passes, builtin only; calibration only | DECISIONS.md opened before the pilot starts |\r\n"]
["o", 0.5150000000000002, "\r\n"]
["o", 0.5500000000000003, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 0.5850000000000003, " 2. PILOT - calibration only: 'how do I run it', never 'does X work'\r\n"]
["o", 0.6200000000000003, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 0.6550000000000004, "3 untimed calibration passes -> noise floor 10.3% of median pass\r\n"]
["o", 0.6900000000000004, "(sets operational expectations; no hypothesis is tested here)\r\n"]
["o", 0.7250000000000004, "appended: | D-002 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Pilot noise floor 10.3%; operational calibration only | 3 calibration passes, spread 10.3% of median pass |\r\n"]
["o", 0.7600000000000005, "\r\n"]
["o", 0.7950000000000005, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 0.8300000000000005, " 3. REGISTRY - DECISIONS.md opened before the pilot; rows at decision time\r\n"]
["o", 0.8650000000000005, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 0.9000000000000006, "appended: | D-003 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Demo design: builtin vs manual loop, paired repeats | same interpreter, same lists |\r\n"]
["o", 0.9350000000000006, "appended: | D-004 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Threshold 10%: below it, the switch is not worth a diff review | practical-significance argument, pre-data |\r\n"]
["o", 0.9700000000000006, "\r\n"]
["o", 1.0050000000000006, "# DECISIONS\r\n"]
["o", 1.0400000000000005, "\r\n"]
["o", 1.0750000000000004, "Append-only registry. One row per decision, written at decision time\r\n"]
["o", 1.1100000000000003, "(use prereg.py decide so the timestamp is mechanical). Never rewrite;\r\n"]
["o", 1.1450000000000002, "a reversed decision gets status SUPERSEDED with a pointer.\r\n"]
["o", 1.1800000000000002, "\r\n"]
["o", 1.215, "| ID | Date | Decision | Evidence |\r\n"]
["o", 1.25, "|----|------|----------|----------|\r\n"]
["o", 1.285, "| D-001 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Pilot plan: 3 calibration passes, builtin only; calibration only | DECISIONS.md opened before the pilot starts |\r\n"]
["o", 1.3199999999999998, "| D-002 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Pilot noise floor 10.3%; operational calibration only | 3 calibration passes, spread 10.3% of median pass |\r\n"]
["o", 1.3549999999999998, "| D-003 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Demo design: builtin vs manual loop, paired repeats | same interpreter, same lists |\r\n"]
["o", 1.3899999999999997, "| D-004 | 2026-11-22 12:55 UTC | Threshold 10%: below it, the switch is not worth a diff review | practical-significance argument, pre-data |\r\n"]
["o", 1.4249999999999996, "\r\n"]
["o", 1.4599999999999995, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 1.4949999999999994, " 4. PREREGISTER - hypotheses, thresholds, analysis plan -> frozen + sha256\r\n"]
["o", 1.5299999999999994, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 1.5649999999999993, "written; nothing confirmatory has been measured yet\r\n"]
["o", 1.5999999999999992, "original: ~/demo/PREREGISTRATION.md\r\n"]
["o", 1.6349999999999991, "sha256:   adfa15e1980779080393b1effc4e4cbcfcebb333caffad27b594b0f7114010cc\r\n"]
["o", 1.669999999999999, "frozen:   ~/demo/docs/PREREGISTRATION_frozen.md\r\n"]
["o", 1.704999999999999, "sha256:   adfa15e1980779080393b1effc4e4cbcfcebb333caffad27b594b0f7114010cc\r\n"]
["o", 1.7399999999999989, "\r\n"]
["o", 1.7749999999999988, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 1.8099999999999987, " 5. RUN - 12 paired repeats, shuffled arm order, raw records only\r\n"]
["o", 1.8449999999999986, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 1.8799999999999986, "24 raw records -> raw_runs.jsonl (one record per run, not a summary)\r\n"]
["o", 1.9149999999999985, "correctness gate: builtin sum == loop sum == reference on every pass: True\r\n"]
["o", 1.9499999999999984, "\r\n"]
["o", 1.9849999999999983, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 2.0199999999999982, " 6. ANALYZE - only the preregistered test, effect + p\r\n"]
["o", 2.0549999999999984, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 2.0899999999999985, "median pass: builtin 0.48 ms vs loop 3.50 ms\r\n"]
["o", 2.1249999999999987, "relative reduction R = 86.3%   (frozen threshold: >= 10%)\r\n"]
["o", 2.159999999999999, "exact two-sided sign-flip p = 0.000488   (frozen alpha: 0.05)\r\n"]
["o", 2.194999999999999, "\r\n"]
["o", 2.229999999999999, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 2.2649999999999992, " 7. VERDICT - looked up from the frozen rule, not argued\r\n"]
["o", 2.2999999999999994, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 2.3349999999999995, "rule: ADOPT builtin if R >= 0.10 AND p < 0.05, else KEEP loop\r\n"]
["o", 2.3699999999999997, "fired: ADOPT builtin  (R = 86.3%, p = 0.000488)\r\n"]
["o", 2.405, "\r\n"]
["o", 2.44, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 2.475, " 8. REPORT - report, manifest, deviations... then the guards refuse to rewrite history\r\n"]
["o", 2.5100000000000002, "================================================================\r\n"]
["o", 2.5450000000000004, "report written -> REPORT-demo.md\r\n"]
["o", 2.5800000000000005, "5 files -> ~/demo/docs/manifest.sha256\r\n"]
["o", 2.6150000000000007, "manifest sha256: aa01cd6bbc077ef0efe43b89579b521c2722076bd0f2e63f24a4f9356f14c144\r\n"]
["o", 2.650000000000001, "Deviations: none found - demo, but the section would be here anyway.\r\n"]
["o", 2.685000000000001, "re-freeze exit 1:\r\n"]
["o", 2.720000000000001, "  freeze: ~/demo/docs/PREREGISTRATION_frozen.md already exists. Do NOT overwrite - the change protocol is append-only addenda ('changed after start, reason').\r\n"]
["o", 2.7550000000000012, "manifest overwrite exit 1:\r\n"]
["o", 2.7900000000000014, "  manifest: ~/demo/docs/manifest.sha256 exists. Manifests are immutable - write a new one for the new state instead.\r\n"]
["o", 2.8250000000000015, "\r\n"]
["o", 2.8600000000000017, "Immutable by default. That is the whole point.\r\n"]
["o", 2.895000000000002, "\r\n"]
["o", 2.930000000000002, "(temp dir removed - your disk is clean)\r\n"]
